  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "31197486",
      "title": "Getting Started with the Game Logic",
      "lectureOrder": 57,
      "videoOrder": 54,
      "sourceHash": "dbfe5584f9fc529f3fa98178c41173a6bcdeb4a38cc9022a97cbe9ba51c3c38b",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.25,
          "end": 3.38,
          "en": "So let's start working",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.38,
          "end": 5.53,
          "en": "on the Game Logic now.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 5.53,
          "end": 8.73,
          "en": "And this includes fetching the user input,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 8.73,
          "end": 11.32,
          "en": "resetting it if we click this button",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 11.32,
          "end": 13.83,
          "en": "and moving on to the actual game screen,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 13.83,
          "end": 15.97,
          "en": "if we confirm the input.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 15.97,
          "end": 18.92,
          "en": "Though, we also wanna validate the input.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 18.92,
          "end": 20.43,
          "en": "For example, we wanna make sure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 20.43,
          "end": 23.38,
          "en": "that if it's empty, we don't proceed",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 23.38,
          "end": 25.23,
          "en": "to the game screen.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 25.23,
          "end": 27.44,
          "en": "That would not be the behavior we want.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 27.44,
          "end": 28.63,
          "en": "Instead in that case,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 28.63,
          "end": 30.24,
          "en": "I wanna show a little alert",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 30.24,
          "end": 32.39,
          "en": "that tells the user that a value",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 32.39,
          "end": 33.933,
          "en": "must be entered here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 34.78,
          "end": 36.8,
          "en": "In addition, I also wanna make sure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 36.8,
          "end": 38.67,
          "en": "that you can't enter,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 38.67,
          "end": 43.01,
          "en": "let's say zero or minus one as a value here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 43.01,
          "end": 44.25,
          "en": "So we'll also have to make sure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 44.25,
          "end": 45.913,
          "en": "that this is not possible.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 46.99,
          "end": 48.56,
          "en": "Now, how can we fetch",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 48.56,
          "end": 52.09,
          "en": "and handle the user input with good old state?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 52.09,
          "end": 55.15,
          "en": "Because again, it is just a React component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 55.15,
          "end": 57.35,
          "en": "and now we wanna fetch some user input",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 57.35,
          "end": 59.58,
          "en": "as we did it before in the course already.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 59.58,
          "end": 61.41,
          "en": "And using state for that is",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 61.41,
          "end": 64.053,
          "en": "of course the standard React way of doing that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 64.94,
          "end": 68.78,
          "en": "Therefore, we should import the useState hook",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 68.78,
          "end": 71.7,
          "en": "from React so that we can manage state",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 71.7,
          "end": 74.08,
          "en": "in this functional component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 74.08,
          "end": 77.75,
          "en": "And here I then have my state for managing or",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 77.75,
          "end": 79.97,
          "en": "for getting this entered value.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 79.97,
          "end": 82.453,
          "en": "And therefore I will name this enteredValue",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 84.16,
          "end": 85.98,
          "en": "or actually enteredNumber,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 85.98,
          "end": 88.26,
          "en": "since it should be a number.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 88.26,
          "end": 92.97,
          "en": "And we have the setEnteredNumber state updating function,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 92.97,
          "end": 94.64,
          "en": "and here out of the box,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 94.64,
          "end": 96.38,
          "en": "this is an empty string.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 96.38,
          "end": 97.7,
          "en": "Now it's a empty string",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 97.7,
          "end": 99.86,
          "en": "instead of a number like zero",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 99.86,
          "end": 102.31,
          "en": "because actually I will bind this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 102.31,
          "end": 103.74000000000001,
          "en": "queue the text input",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 103.74000000000001,
          "end": 106.61,
          "en": "and even if you have \"number-pad\" here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 106.61,
          "end": 108.35,
          "en": "what you will get as a value",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 108.35,
          "end": 110.28999999999999,
          "en": "will always be a string.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 110.28999999999999,
          "end": 112.85,
          "en": "It will always be of type string",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 112.85,
          "end": 114.75999999999999,
          "en": "even if the text is a number,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 114.75999999999999,
          "end": 117.38,
          "en": "even if the text contains a number",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 117.38,
          "end": 119.22999999999999,
          "en": "and that's the same as in the web.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 119.22999999999999,
          "end": 121.12,
          "en": "So what we get from TextInput",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 121.12,
          "end": 122.55,
          "en": "will always be a string.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 122.55,
          "end": 124.74,
          "en": "We can of course convert it thereafter.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 124.74,
          "end": 127.35,
          "en": "But since I plan on binding this state",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 127.35,
          "end": 128.69,
          "en": "to the TextInput,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 128.69,
          "end": 131.55,
          "en": "I also wanna manage a string here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 131.55,
          "end": 134.34,
          "en": "Now with bind this to the TextInput,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 134.34,
          "end": 137.22,
          "en": "I mean that I wanna set the value prop",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 137.22,
          "end": 138.053,
          "en": "on TextInput",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 139.22,
          "end": 142.188,
          "en": "and set this equal to enteredNumber.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 142.188,
          "end": 143.02100000000002,
          "en": "I do this so",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 143.02100000000002,
          "end": 144.68,
          "en": "that we can change the state",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 144.68,
          "end": 146.48,
          "en": "from anywhere in this app.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 146.48,
          "end": 148.91,
          "en": "For example, when the Reset button is clicked",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 148.91,
          "end": 150.82,
          "en": "to reset it to an empty string",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 150.82,
          "end": 153.75,
          "en": "and such state changes are then reflected",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 153.75,
          "end": 154.96,
          "en": "in TextInput.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 154.96,
          "end": 156.93,
          "en": "That's why I'm setting the value prop",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 156.93,
          "end": 158.61,
          "en": "to the state.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 158.61,
          "end": 160.34,
          "en": "But of course, we also wanna update",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 160.34,
          "end": 161.99,
          "en": "this enteredNumber state",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 161.99,
          "end": 163.31,
          "en": "whenever the user types",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 163.31,
          "end": 164.9,
          "en": "into the TextInput field.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 164.9,
          "end": 167.41,
          "en": "And for this, we can add a function,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 167.41,
          "end": 171.35,
          "en": "the numberInputHandler, for example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 171.35,
          "end": 174.32,
          "en": "which should be executed upon every keystroke",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 174.32,
          "end": 175.77,
          "en": "which can be achieved",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 175.77,
          "end": 179.71,
          "en": "by adding the onChangeText prop here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 179.71,
          "end": 181.22,
          "en": "to this TextInput.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 181.22,
          "end": 184.44,
          "en": "And then we point at this numberInputHandler",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 184.44,
          "end": 187.08,
          "en": "and this will in the end execute this function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 187.08,
          "end": 189.09,
          "en": "on every keystroke that is done",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 189.09,
          "end": 189.99,
          "en": "on this TextInput.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 191.24,
          "end": 192.3,
          "en": "And conveniently,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 192.3,
          "end": 195.62,
          "en": "we automatically get the inputText",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 195.62,
          "end": 199.54,
          "en": "or the enteredText passed into this function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 199.54,
          "end": 200.94,
          "en": "by React Native.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 200.94,
          "end": 202.9,
          "en": "So we automatically get a value",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 202.9,
          "end": 205.29,
          "en": "for this parameter because React Native",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 205.29,
          "end": 207.29,
          "en": "will invoke this function for us",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 207.29,
          "end": 209.777,
          "en": "for every keystroke on the TextInput.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 210.94,
          "end": 214.12,
          "en": "And in here I'll then set my enteredNumber",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 214.12,
          "end": 216.55,
          "en": "to the enteredText.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 216.55,
          "end": 219.32,
          "en": "So I'll update my state with the text entered",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 219.32,
          "end": 220.573,
          "en": "into this input field.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 221.41,
          "end": 222.76,
          "en": "Now that is all nice.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 222.76,
          "end": 224.75,
          "en": "That's a good first step.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 224.75,
          "end": 226.82,
          "en": "The second step of course is",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 226.82,
          "end": 228.853,
          "en": "to connect this Confirm button.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 229.76,
          "end": 233.29,
          "en": "For this, I'll add another function here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 233.29,
          "end": 237.19,
          "en": "which I'll name confirmInputHandler.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 237.19,
          "end": 238.75,
          "en": "And the idea here is",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 238.75,
          "end": 241.44,
          "en": "that we then check the current state",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 241.44,
          "end": 243.9,
          "en": "that we have, we check if it's a number",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 243.9,
          "end": 246.3,
          "en": "and if it's greater or equal than one",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 246.3,
          "end": 248.62,
          "en": "and smaller or equal than 99",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 248.62,
          "end": 252.09,
          "en": "because I only wanna allow numbers in that range.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 252.09,
          "end": 254.37,
          "en": "And then we proceed to the next screen",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 254.37,
          "end": 257.39300000000003,
          "en": "if it's valid and we show an alert, otherwise.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 258.39,
          "end": 259.88,
          "en": "Now let's first connect this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 259.88,
          "end": 261.26,
          "en": "to the Button though.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 261.26,
          "end": 263.31,
          "en": "And for this, our PrimaryButton",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 263.31,
          "end": 266.25,
          "en": "should expose a prop that does allow us",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 266.25,
          "end": 268.33,
          "en": "to pass in a function.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 268.33,
          "end": 271.15,
          "en": "And if we have a look at the PrimaryButton,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 271.15,
          "end": 274.47,
          "en": "then at the moment we don't use any props",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 274.47,
          "end": 277.46,
          "en": "in here that would take a function.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 277.46,
          "end": 281.6,
          "en": "Instead here, our Pressable does have the onPress prop",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 281.6,
          "end": 284.12,
          "en": "and we point at the the pressHandler",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 284.12,
          "end": 287.15,
          "en": "but there, we just log to the console.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 287.15,
          "end": 289.74,
          "en": "Now I want to make this button reusable.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 289.74,
          "end": 292.88,
          "en": "I want to make this custom component reusable.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 292.88,
          "end": 295.64,
          "en": "And I wanna add a prop that allows components",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 295.64,
          "end": 298.27,
          "en": "that use this Button component to pass",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 298.27,
          "end": 301.73,
          "en": "in a function that will be executed upon a press.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 301.73,
          "end": 305.41,
          "en": "And therefore here I'll also pull out another prop",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 305.41,
          "end": 308.01,
          "en": "from that incoming props object,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 308.01,
          "end": 310.31,
          "en": "which I'll name onPress.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 310.31,
          "end": 311.56,
          "en": "Now, this name is up to you",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 311.56,
          "end": 314.27,
          "en": "because this is your component and your props,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 314.27,
          "end": 317.2,
          "en": "but it makes sense to use onPress I'd say",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 317.2,
          "end": 319.46,
          "en": "because we know that we want a function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 319.46,
          "end": 320.71,
          "en": "that should be invoked",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 320.71,
          "end": 323.04,
          "en": "when that button is pressed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 134,
          "start": 323.04,
          "end": 325.35,
          "en": "So that is a name that makes sense to me",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 135,
          "start": 325.35,
          "end": 327.11,
          "en": "but it's not a must use",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 136,
          "start": 327.11,
          "end": 329.65,
          "en": "because it is your component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 137,
          "start": 329.65,
          "end": 334.5,
          "en": "In pressHandler, we can then execute onPress",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 138,
